[[15,3,0,"<p>The paintwork identification plate is located on the left front door.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179008135.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p>The bodywork paint code is in box H</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179008136.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><ul class=\"legend\"><li>A. Tyre inflation pressure with no load.</li><li>B. Tyre inflation pressure fully laden.</li><li>C. Tyre size</li><li>D. Rim size</li><li>E. Type of tyre fitted on vehicle</li><li>F. Vehicle manufacture date identification code</li><li>G. Empty box</li><li>H. Paintwork code.</li><li>I. Vehicle manufacture code</li></ul></figure>"]]